      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is incredibly difficult to find hope when the world feels empty without the person who once gave it meaning to you. While the pain feels pointless in the moment, feeling a \"shadow self\" is a common and painful stage of grief that can help you heal over time.\n\nI encourage you to share these heavy thoughts with a compassionate listener or a trusted support professional who can help you navigate these feelings even when you don't feel the energy to do so.",
